cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite the paper below."
title: "Persona-Aware Cognitive-Bias Benchmark (data rebuild)"
abstract: >-
  A reconstruction of the data resources from the LREC 2026 paper
  "Persona-Aware Evaluation of Cognitive Bias in LLMs": a 12-category, 120-item
  cognitive-bias benchmark, a 162-persona factorial space, and 100 matched
  gain/loss financial framing tasks.
